  "gaps": [
    "Microlino prices (EUR/CHF/GBP) not sourced; Wikipedia gives two slightly different battery/range sets (6/10.5/14 kWh with about 91/177/230 km vs an infobox 5.5-15 kWh and 93-228 km); the specification-section figures are used.",
    "Microlino Lite power converted from 6 kW (8 hp) and standard car from 12.5 kW (17 hp); Spiaggina battery not stated.",
    "Microlino's website lists the United States among its countries, but no US sales or homologation could be confirmed, so no US market is recorded.",
    "No 2025-2026 news on Micro Mobility Systems' finances or production volume could be checked (web search budget ran out); a June 2024 Le Monde report said Microlino was seeking help to keep building cars in Italy."
  ]
